WEBVTT

NOTE Kings Apollo walkthrough. Cue starts from the approved narration; ends estimated from line length.

1
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.692
Come on in. Let's check it out.

2
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.385
The first thing I'm going to point out is this amazing, super huge generator.

3
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.900
With brownouts in the area, you definitely want a property that has a generator this big.

4
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.538
This powers the entire building, both towers, and they have a separate generator for the lift itself.

5
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.154
When it comes to parking, that is important. There are three levels to this parking lot,

6
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.000
and each unit gets two parking spots. That's a big deal in Nairobi.

7
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.000
This is the third floor. Three levels plus two parking spots per unit.

8
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:56.900
One of the greatest things about Kings is that you and your family can get away

9
00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.769
and have space for your children to breathe. Let's take a look in the theater.

10
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:19.900
If you want to feel like a king, Kings does it well. You have a full theater

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:28.308
with an amazing surround sound system. Set up a movie night with your family, or for the whole complex.

12
00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:01.231
We are in unit 1206, and it's about to surprise you.

13
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.308
Welcome to Kings Apollo, 12th floor.

14
00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:24.615
It has nothing but open space, open air. You've got a balcony,

15
00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:37.385
plenty of space for a little set, maybe a swing chair, and the view.

16
00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:02.538
Right here we enter the kitchen. Plenty of counter and cabinet space, and space for your fridge.

17
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:15.900
You do have to purchase your own fridge, but it comes with a microwave and an oven.

18
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:21.231
A five-burner gas stove, and a double sink with an extender.

19
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:40.154
Out here you have the laundry area. Your washer goes here and your dryer back there.

20
00:05:51.000 --> 00:06:00.077
This is your DSQ. You can fit a bed here. It has its own entry and a bathroom with a shower.

21
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:27.000
The first bedroom. Plenty of space, and sliding glass windows with a view.

22
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:50.000
No matter where you are in Kings Apollo, you will have a view.
